Is this the Exploration Report of the Royal Mage who is on the Road to the Wind, holding the portal?

I see you played a key part and showed great courage. It must have been hard, but that is war.
Much happened while you were in the Shadow Dimension.
This data will be of great value.

Train hard; your help will be needed in the Abyss of the Sea. When that time comes, look for Celina; she will guide you with the wisdom of the great Idhas.

Receive this Royal Earring as a reward for your effort.
It may be useful on your journey.
